            <p>**I wanted to create something truly special for you today because you deserve nothing less than the absolute best.</p>Back then, I never imagined a day where I'd prepare a birthday gift for you. We shared the same class from the start, but I couldn't stand you in your group. I disliked your personality from afar—unaware of how my world was about to change.</p>I want to write more in this letter but, this page can't hold it any longer😅.</p>
